{"id":"brust","lemma":"Brust","pos":"noun","rank":1575,"glosses":["chest","breast (of a woman); side of the chest (of a man)","bosom (seat of thoughts and feelings)"],"ipa":"/bʁʊst/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f3/De-Brust.ogg/De-Brust.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Brust","plural":"Brüste"},"examples":[{"text":"Meine Brust tut weh.","en":"My chest hurts.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/695281","words":[{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null,{"g":"to do","l":"tun"},{"g":"sore, painful"}]},{"text":"Untersuchen Sie selbst regelmäßig Ihre Brüste?","en":"Do you regularly perform self-breast examinations?","words":[{"g":"to examine"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"even"},{"g":"regular"},{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},null]},{"text":"Er hatte drei Schusswunden in der Brust.","en":"He had three bullet wounds in his chest.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"three (numerical value…"},{"g":"gunshot wound","l":"Schusswunde"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Tom hat eine behaarte Brust.","en":"Tom has a hairy chest.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/757831","words":[null,{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"a"},null,null]},{"text":"Mir schmerzt die Brust beim Atmen.","en":"My chest hurts when I breathe.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"to hurt, to ache","l":"schmerzen"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"at the"},{"g":"to breathe"}]}]}